    objective: "Recommend a consensus mechanism for three different scenarios and defend each choice.",
    scenario: "Recommend a consensus mechanism for: (1) a public currency run by strangers, (2) a bank consortium of ten known banks, (3) a school alumni network of 50 members.",
    steps: ["Add three Heading 2 sections, one per scenario.", "In each, name a mechanism (proof of work, proof of stake, BFT-style voting or a simple trusted database) and give two reasons.", "Mention at least one trade-off (energy, speed, decentralisation or trust).", "Keep it between 130 and 300 words."],
